# macOS
.DS_Store

# Runtime artifacts
SESSION.log
RUNBOOK.md
CHECKPOINT.md
.worktrees/

# Local-only orchestration docs (excluded from GitHub per owner decision 2026-07-19).
# Kept on the working tree only; the rest of docs/ (evidence-ledger.md, adr/, decisions-log.md,
# contracts, compliance, gates, design, sme-dispatch) stays tracked + on GitHub + CI-readable.
docs/prompts/
docs/audits/

# Orchestrator machine-state handoff — deliberately local-only, never enters the repo (rewritten
# every session; see MEMORY.md orchestrator-operating-model / v2-execution-state notes).
/handoff.yaml

# Owner's private working file — not for GitHub/CI (docs/reports/ itself stays tracked; only this
# one file is excluded).
docs/reports/amh-integration-forensics-summary.md

# Plano de execucao do Terraform: pode conter valores resolvidos (endpoints, ARNs)
# e nao deve viajar no repositorio.
*.tfplan

# Agent-session working outputs — engagement deliverables produced by local agent runs from this
# cwd, NOT platform source (verified unrelated to maezo code 2026-08-24: self-contained regulatory-
# analysis bundle, ~421 MB of downloaded public sources + rendered artifacts + agent-run state).
# Local-only by design; never `git add` wholesale.
/outputs/

# Claude Code ephemera: session worktrees (branch refs live in the main .git) and the
# per-user local settings override that must never carry credentials into the repo.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
